[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お邪魔しまーす！\nレスナ、あれから何か進展は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hope you don't mind us dropping by!\nResna, any progress since...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "っとと……お休み中かぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh... looks like she's sleeping."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと前に眠ったところなんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, she just dozed off a little while ago."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん最近寝てなかったから、\nこのまま休ませてあげたいんだけど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She hasn't been sleeping much lately, so I'd like to let her rest if we can..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん、もちろんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Of course, no problem."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……目元が濡れてる。もしかして、泣いてた？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Her eyes are wet. Was she crying?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ん、少しだけ。レスナちゃん、\n本当は辛いのずっと我慢してたみたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mm, a little. Seems like she's been holding back her pain this whole time."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そっか……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、大丈夫？\nケガとかしてない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you alright?\nYou're not hurt anywhere, are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だ、大丈夫です！\n助けていただき、ありがとうございました！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm fine!\nThank you so much for coming to help!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "み、皆さんを……危険な目に、\nあわせてしまって……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I-I'm so sorry for...\nputting everyone in danger...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本当に、ごめんなさい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I truly apologize..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でも、もうめそめそしません！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But I won't mope around anymore!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術も人生も、七転び八起き。\nこう仰りたいのですね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In alchemy and in life, fall down seven times, get up eight!\nThat's how it is, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは、なんか違うけど、どういたしまして！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha, well, not exactly, but close enough!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの頃から、とっても成長してすごいなって思ってた\nけど、いっぱいいっぱいのところで頑張ってたんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I've been thinking how amazing it is to see how much you've grown since back then, but you've really been pushing yourself to your limit, huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……でもね、レスナ。\n一人で全部抱え込まなくていいんだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But you know what, Resna?\nYou don't have to shoulder everything alone."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あたしたちも力になるから。\nみんなで一緒に頑張ろう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're here to help too.\nLet's all work together, okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]